# .gsuconf — configuration for git-standup
# Lines starting with # are comments.
# Use `exclude=` or a leading `-` to exclude projects.
# Use `include=` or a leading `+` to include projects.
# This file excludes the current project directory from scans.
# Example usages:
# include=/path/to/your/project
# exclude=/path/to/your/project
# +/path/to/your/project
# -/path/to/your/project
